d=base('build_water_trial_planners','The water-trial planning board','Summer 1 • Build a method another team could follow',33,'Plan a controlled comparison of water amount and plant growth, with repeated plants and consistent records.',[('change','The factor deliberately made different.'),('measure','Find and record a quantity.'),('control','A condition kept comparable.'),('repeat','Use further observations or plants to check variation.')],['State a testable water-amount question.','Keep relevant conditions comparable.','Plan repeated plants, dates and a height rule.'],['Plants need suitable water.','Height and leaf condition provide different clues.'],[('Changing water and light tests water alone.','Two changes prevent separating their effects.','Ask what else could explain a difference.'),('A prediction belongs in the results column.','Predictions are expectations; results are actual measurements.','Ask whether the measurement has happened.'),('One plant represents all plants.','Individuals vary; matched repeats improve a comparison.','Ask why each group has three seedlings.')],[RHS,SAPS])
d['equipment']+=['Optional six matched, established young bean seedlings in labelled 200 mL pots with drainage; trays; ruler; measuring syringe or cylinder; adult-approved compost.']
