d['safety']=['Use non-toxic plants; no tasting or direct handling of fertiliser. Wash hands after handling plants or compost.','Keep water in trays away from electrical devices; wipe spills. Use needle-free measuring equipment.','An adult checks plants daily. Stop or adjust a real treatment if severe stress develops; record the change honestly. Do not overheat or seal plants in a cupboard.']
planrecord=[('Question','How does daily water amount affect growth of these young bean seedlings over 10 days?'),('Groups','A1–A3: 5 mL each daily. B1–B3: 15 mL each daily. These amounts are a fictional teaching plan.'),('Keep comparable','Species, age, starting size, pot and compost; light, temperature, drainage and measurement times.'),('Record','On days 0, 3, 7 and 10: each plant’s height in cm from soil to main shoot tip; leaf colour and condition.'),('Care and honesty','Check daily. Keep actual records, including any missed measurement or necessary care change.')]
