d=base('build_growth_record_studio','The growth-record studio','Summer 1 • See ten days of evidence in forty minutes',34,'Set up a consistent growth record and use dated repeated measurements to describe change over time.',[('baseline','The starting measurement for comparison.'),('interval','The time between observations.'),('variation','Differences between individual readings.'),('missing','A value that was not recorded; not the same as zero.')],['Use a plant ID, date, unit and fixed height rule.','Read change across the supplied dates.','Retain variation and distinguish missing from zero.'],['A fair plan compares similar plants with one intended change.','Height and leaf condition provide complementary evidence.'],[('The final height is the amount of growth.','Growth in height is final minus starting height.','Compare 11 cm final with 3 cm baseline.'),('No reading means zero growth or zero height.','A missing reading cannot be replaced by zero.','Ask whether a measurement was actually made.'),('Each repeat must have the same value.','Individual plants vary; keep the observed differences.','Compare B1–B3 on day 10.')],[SAPS,RHS])
